     "x": "Small update the vibe has kind of shifted since it's Sunday they let us clean up at the barracks at 8 PM. We woke up at 3 AM and have church tomorrow for the first time in a week. I've had a few laughs. They never let us chat but after formation, I chatted with Franco About chess God League of Legends talk to some guy about lifting there was a crowd in the center of the barracks I managed to lift 320 once some African dude did a handstand to cheer. I began joking with this guy named REED, a guy from Tibet is my bunk map below me there's also a funny Kentucky guy. There's a guy who reminds me a lot of Hunter McDavitt there's a Russian New York City guy. He's hilarious. He was in arms and all of us laugh over stories from reception just like our stories he had some funny ones about fat retarded recruits we shared funny Poop stories about fart symphonies, and PT just writing this right now, but my face felt warm from laughing. I'm writing this in the dark now because lights off I'm also friends with this cool guy who's jacked it's a lot better than packing tight in a penguin formation."
