    {
     "t": "p",
     "x": "Wasted all day standing still with a rifle they got the usual screamed at the chow hall. It's the only time I get to eat with a roof. I've lost more weight drills Sergeant. I need to talk to you was MIA. I'm terrified about losing section 8 contacting them through Jackson. It's like a sword of Damocles Hangs above me 65 more days I think wake up is at 0 500 there's so many thoughts I have through the day that blur into the pain of that same day. I don't have a choice to quit, but I'd lie if I said, I didn't daydream, even though it would ruin my life",
     "c": "Wasted all day standing still with a rifle they got the usual screamed at the chow hall. It's the only time I get to eat with a roof. I've lost more weight drills Sergeant. I need to talk to you was MIA. I'm terrified about losing section 8 contacting them through Jackson. It's like a sword of Damocles Hangs above me 65 more days I think wake up is at 0500 there's so many thoughts I have through the day that blur into the pain of that same day. I don't have a choice to quit, but I'd lie if I said, I didn't daydream, even though it would ruin my life"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "x": "I think about poetic ways to tell you how meaningful and beautiful you are and amazing and special while I'm marching, but my body is so worn out the final 2 to 7 minutes I have to write. I'm so worried about what I missed or will miss this deployment or any in the future genuinely I know I repeat myself but seven days of rest nonstop with these people, it felt like four months already selfishly I really hope you support me because I have so many doubts and worries if this is even worth it I just don't know knowing if I break a leg and I'm still stuck here forced to restart is scary."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "x": "We finally have hot water took my first shower and silently cried there again. I've been so distant not just to you we're friends, but any. Vice a good rest conversation, a full stomach coffee, let alone being drunk or a vape pit. These things are really luxurious. I've not heard a song in so long the ones I thought I knew I realize they're getting hazy. I just spent all day standing and shivering just being stuck and introspective. I'm so jaded nothing deep, profound or artistic. The only thing I look forward to writing this journal I keep looking forward to talking to you, but I feel like it's always just out of reach all my happy thoughts are so distant a bittersweet this journal is quite depressing. It's just cause I hold it all in. Here's a day-to-day."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "x": "Wake up at 4:54 AM jumped out of my top bunkbed change, shave head down to morning formation always end up in the front Joe Sergeant drill sergeant Aunt only talk to me once telling me to tuck in my boots the boots we have her ass I ripped up a sock so it stops cutting out my ankles morning, PT walking and carry food eat, and shower. Go inside the bathroom latrine joke with Robinson, Karagach Harmon Libby in a few passing combos with Franco, IM, or people laugh than more workouts about nothing eating outside all day the last two hours once we lineup drill Sergeant comes we do a personnel check I joke with the same people funny nothing stories reed found dice smuggle in here in a highlighter which you gave me. I wish I could share this experience with someone I put off studying I'll get smoke tomorrow. This is the only way I feel close to you. Sorry I'm not sweet. I'm just beat.",
     "c": "Wake up at 4:54 AM jumped out of my top bunkbed change, shave head down to morning formation always end up in the front drill sergeant drill sergeant Aunt only talk to me once telling me to tuck in my boots the boots we have her ass I ripped up a sock so it stops cutting out my ankles morning, PT walking and carry food eat, and shower. Go inside the bathroom latrine joke with Robinson, Karagach Herman Libby in a few passing combos with Franco, IM, or people laugh than more workouts about nothing eating outside all day the last two hours once we lineup drill sergeant comes we do a personnel check I joke with the same people funny nothing stories reed found dice smuggle in here in a highlighter which you gave me. I wish I could share this experience with someone I put off studying I'll get smoke tomorrow. This is the only way I feel close to you. Sorry I'm not sweet. I'm just beat."
    }
