     "t": "p",
     "x": "Honestly, I got a taste of being an officer and motivated me to never settle. I was a goat at the obstacle course had a warm plate and a heated car with music escort the six of us to our usual drill building the classroom where we were introduced ourselves and talked about our goals and about the things we hear in the base the power won't go to my head because there is none anyways we were driven down to the sea burn Facility in empty compound with shaded bleachers a field rocky roads and some shacks. We drove past the company wrecking from the obstacle course the other trucks brought our rock and rifle after three hours of nothing waiting going over how to put on a gas mask.",
     "c": "Honestly, I got a taste of being an officer and motivated me to never settle. I was a goat at the obstacle course had a warm plate and a heated car with music escort the six of us to our usual drill building the classroom where we were introduced ourselves and talked about our goals and about the things we hear in the base the power won't go to my head because there is none anyways we were driven down to the sea burn Facility in empty compound with shaded bleachers a field rocky roads and some shacks. We drove past the company wrecking from the obstacle course the other trucks brought our ruck and rifle after three hours of nothing waiting going over how to put on a gas mask."
