     "x": "I know I'm just a single guy without any status or a religious background, but I think a lot about this. I really hope hell is empty or nearly empty in Jesus. Message of radical forgiveness is maintained. I know I can have hate in my heart for my fellow man, but I want to learn to forgive my enemies or those were betrayed me. It's so much easier than it looks sometimes even now and then I suffer circumstances to question everything over again firewatch And this page are beginning to wrap up. I hope you enjoy these rambles fortunately for you I'm out of space so you will not have to sit down for me to discuss currency and how it proves humans are not on a cyclical historic course but a single direction no due overs."
