     "t": "p",
     "x": "It's weird having a moment to think let's see how my feeling I had a dream. I was a 6V6 airsoft match everyone had rifles, but I had only an empty shotgun when the whistle went off, I had to drop my shotgun running scavenged ammunition while my team was picked off one by one. I was the last man standing, tried rushing for rifle on the ground, only for a knife plate to slice my neck from a man on the other team, the whistle blue I held my neck and watch my reflection in a puddle of blood on the ground. The reflection was occasionally obstructed as drops of blood fell and ripped into the water the puddle I was not worried for my safety just sad that I lost though. I thought I thought I'd let myself and my team down that's around when I woke."
