     "x": "I found it weird what I miss of course lately. My lovely girlfriend is number one but besides food, I don't care about a lot. Maybe it's. Maslows hierarchy of needs where I'll miss my stuff later but I miss some obscure things. I have no idea why I wanna play old Pokemon so badly if they're not touching it for 15 years, I do not crave alcohol nicotine sex just quiet time with a single player game, maybe my introvert ness has taken over maybe some consciously this place reminds me of school. I don't know like elementary school and that makes my mind want more. I feel like I'm torn between needing an eventful social stimulating life yet also a peaceful quiet solo one I guess I needed about 50-50 but the problem is I cannot pick how I'll feel one day."
