     "x": "Rain day it's 711. We woke up. Did PT sprints Herman is so dang fast. We drew weapons changed it to OCPs Franco and Arthur and I are sharing Dad jokes excited for breakfast week is almost over 18 hours. I'm still tired after a day like that, but it feels normal. An eight hour workday would be nice worried about Hubbard and those around him. I don't think we'll have a verbatim private pile situation, but the comparisons have become More than uncanny the drill sergeant in platoon agrees I don't want him to hurt anyone or himself drill sergeants are more aware of his red flags. I don't wanna be next to him."
