     "x": "Genuinely though it's inhumane cold we're not allowed to have layers two more got hospitalized. We're in short sleeve standing still in 20 degrees, not including the incredible winter winds of actually 16 hours total I cannot think or move. I'm pissed about the weather I can handle anything but Gould I take six months in Iraq then one month of this winter I'm bitter and hungry. A lot of people's mannerisms are annoying me so many thoughts so many things many of which will never be said forgotten to time decay. If I write that book do a chapter on clouds making me weep do do the impermanence. These notes will only make sense to me, but also discuss and pacifism also booger icicles are real and terrible."
