     "x": "I was woken amid some dream. Something about a court case against people from the bay the plot twist everyone is innocent. The charges were filed wrong and they named the wrong company anyway to build a more accurate picture of today 0445 we got into OCPs got our guns agent MR freezing we were bus to the range sat on bleachers. Sit still in silent until 1030. We did the drill staggered 13 man wedge yellow drone drone drone pick up resupply just like they want get down when you hear mortars go off drop the item and run. We did things like bounds which is that I'm up. He sees me. I'm down to gunshots do eight count push-ups or the half jack It's hard as fuck after running uphill with your helmet the plate carrier pads I shot 13 with a laser site and had three jams it was fun for five minutes but then at 10:45 we were still until 1700 genuinely every second was agony time pass so slow even after four hours of sunshine. My extremities are pulsing. Had a close call. I thought Jill sergeants were coming. I found my lock. I don't know what to ponder on the rock in the cold tomorrow last time was modern warfare two I don't know if other games are what to think about sleeping in 10 minutes. I'm excited but not to wake up 21 degrees tomorrow, including wind no sniffle gear fucking three days gonna miss out gonna miss our mold, infested, stuffy bleach home it's warmth Super seeds all else super seeds all else",
