     "c": "on our ruck. I enjoyed the ruck. I was behind Libby in front of Arthur and oh we have weapon slings now it's a fantastic invention invention I was staying warm. Best I reasonably could I went through my middle school self discography I thought about Green Day song for the first few hours and more about the Pokemon ROM as well as seeing the sunrise AnyWho, we take off our rucks at the campsite split into a male section. I was partnered with Arthur but drill sergeant Spencer said \"Gowdre\" (joudrie) you're here now and I was switched and I still don't know why perhaps it was divine intervention because it was Herman. I was very happy"
