     "c": "Wednesday that fire guard was chilly and bam wake up it was freezing. Somehow we had some MREs. I got a deal with Bruno who hates his MREs and for $20. He said he would give me any MRE that he doesn't want we did face paint. Everyone said mine was pretty bad ass and I look like a green beret to me it's easy because dark colors soften harder features like bones but a lot of people just look like the Hulk with the make up kicked on anyways we did squad drills with Dupree. I was EPW I was in Alpha squad team bravo team to the flank, the blank ammunition we had kept jamming which sucked, but we returned fire put a tourniquet on a dummy avoided mortars scattered under the drone. We had a red sky drills hit a foxhole for a bit. Did a cool sector sketch that commander Matthew just took a picture of Jill. Sergeant Madden liked our foxhole Arthur Colt Rider and Hazen packed into our hole doodle a little bit."
