     "x": "I had lots of old memories that have been returning to Me lately like bowling with the Mauriellos in kindergarten birthdays of childhood and booster seats my old pet fish named Lucky neighbors in apartment complexes from nearly 20 years ago Rich detail. I remembered how old I remembered how pink my old bathroom was. I remember the quilt patterns of the motels, the old sleds I used to have in winter time in kindergarten the route from preschool. I remember watching lightning storms with my mother before I could speak I thought about my departed grandparents I thought about dogs I thought about as a kid I would dance on this rug I remember sitting on a warm car seat as the sun casts down on me or watching clouds with my older brother there's a lot not new but they're so different from what life is now they almost feel like these memories are not mine."
