     "t": "p",
     "x": "but yeah, we did PT We dropped our sheets to. We ran 2 miles. I love the pack maybe had my first runners high I was so excited to sprint to the finish but yeah I got rifle. Heavy ass plates had to pee waited. Weather got better 70 degrees but yeah I got smokes because a lot of people cannot be quiet. No meal time again I talked with Bruno I really wanna talk And write more but everyone keeps interrupting me. I look forward to writing every day at home. It sucks. I'm so distracted right now. Bruno filled the AFD and I will make sure he passes.",
