     "c": "also Herman taught me the concept of a mind palace that is Sherlock Holmes uses where he imagines a physical place where he can walk around and pick up memories which I thought was really cool. I wondered about things like radio waves, and how they work in space and how they can travel at the speed of light it confuse me because I thought radio waves are like sound and how sound does not move at the speed of light, I thought about if there could be a device that could use a radio signal to emit the human genome into space I thought about how if the speed of light and it confuse me how photons can be gathered to have mass, but they have no mass by themselves which is confusing, I thought about gravitational pull like if you have photons in Planck length that has to have some graphics to it right I thought about teleportation like you could have a device that uses radio signals to send a blueprint of what you want to teleport like a machine that's capable of building things and it just waits on a radio signal to build it and how you could even have that transfer information across planets or something for my sci-fi I wanna have a concept of light that's magnetic drill sergeant Aguilera asked me if I was even in this company"
