     "c": "I woke up so sore everyone did for the victory breakfast that we dreamed for days of pizza, coffee, and ice cream as promised but unfortunately, that was a lie but OK breakfast nonetheless I had to meet fast on Fridays so no sausage or wings but I got French toast eggs grits, veggie sausage, raisin bran strawberry pop, tart cookies, blueberry strawberry banana, Uncrustables great but only 15 minutes. Nobody finished"
