     "x": "Hubbard is unfortunately getting tea again because his sister is unfortunately super gorgeous so the whole platoon was kind of joking on him. Maxine and I discussed Vietnam travel Japanese pot hotels a joke with the squad a lot I thought about a lot of stuff I'm just beat. It's 4 AM and we have to wake up for shots again. I'm gonna try to get the specialist logo there. Halsey blessed me with an extra pair of boots. Everything went smooth today. And I went sneaking into the bathroom, tossing my hat on everything worked out."
