     "x": "Anyways today was a great day. We got bust over to reception. We got two shots. I talked to Matthew about Hubbard. I also talk to him about music like Khalid. It kind of reminded me of the Walton drew a cool skull then I bust. It was cold as fuck. Someone got caught for snivel gear. We got smoked. We cleaned guns. Mine was clean as fuck so Arthur Cunningham Fedorowicz gossip about the boys who like Cunningham went to the bathroom found Merritt there again we were all fucking around. Arthur accidentally punched me in the face on my nose bleed, but we laughed because it looked like 11 from Stranger Things where I was bald with a bloody nose. I had a breath that never happened. We got yearbooks. My car got declined. Arthur spotted me but I got 50 signatures so far that was pretty much it. Dupriest smoked us breathing through these entry. I love these guys. I chatted with Hubbard. I borrowed his Bible. He borrowed my pen and we talked about the Bible. I went to the bathroom. It was super trash there and I found a Merritt there again just lying down sleeping I wrote global on the ceiling Gullible on the ceiling."
